  "carbonneutralgoal": "SOMEWHAT ILL-DEFINED: both sides accept CN; read as pro = accelerate/ambitious CN via investment, tech, renewables (incl. H2/ammonia); con = prioritise economic realism, avoid rapid transition, stress burden/costs. Left critics of H2/ammonia who want faster cuts coded pro",
  "localvsnatinalrole": "pro = local governments/communities lead (local production-consumption of renewables) with national financial support; con = national-led uniform policy, local role complementary; almost nobody argues the con side, so most are pro or na"
